{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟CEO薩蒂亞·納德拉（Satya Nadella）稱讚已遭罷免的英偉達創始人黃仁勳是一位「獨一無二的人」，並指出他對科技行業做出了巨大貢獻。不過，納德拉並未明確呼籲讓黃仁勳重返這家晶片製造商的最高領導崗位。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586908.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:47:02.544789+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:29:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:20.985839+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:20.985839+00:00","content_hash":"c18d3db51b104577d99e3353aac8df07d33ae263b5e28bf15443a4f296b9b3f4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}